          "markdownEnumDescriptions": [
            "### Clear\n\n**Identifier**: `TLP:CLEAR`\n\n_Vocabulary_ : `Traffic Light Protocol`\n\n---\n\nRecipients can spread this to the world, there is no limit on disclosure.\n",
