            "### Amber+Strict\n\n**Identifier**: `TLP:AMBER+STRICT`\n\n_Vocabulary_ : `Traffic Light Protocol`\n\n---\n\nSimilar to TLP:AMBER, but restricts sharing to the organization only.\n",
