# Credential Access Objective

*Detection objective · `objective::1.0` · version 1 · modified 2026-01-02 · TLP:CLEAR*

Detect credential access techniques

| Property | Value |
| --- | --- |
| Priority | High |
| Type | Threat |
| Composition | Combined |
